BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_316706393@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052248Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T113000
SUMMARY:5 Week Course: The Work on Inadequacy (Timing Option A) Price - Sl
 iding Scale
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nTo celebrate 5 years of The Work Runs Free
 \, Emrys has created The Work on Inadequacy. Over 5 weeks\, we explore dif
 ferent ways the experience of inadequacy shows up in our lives\, using The
  Work to investigate our experience.\n\nSign up form: [Click Here](https:/
 /docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeQVso7QaCu9ubv5E_74f50c6vvp2nt7zx8zMWnl
 GkwaNIYMw/viewform?usp=preview)\nDetailed Course Outline: [Click Here](htt
 ps://docs.google.com/document/d/1eQYHU2jgRlNoO_XZDEjj08EhT8jeHk0h2zAOnEogl
 gM/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n**Sliding Scale Price:** $120 — Accessible rate 
 / $150 — Standard rate / $180 — Pay it forward\n\n**Please note: the t
 iming of Timing Option A will go back one hour from Sat Nov 7th onwards to
  6AM PDT / 9AM EDT**\n\n**Week 1 — I'm Not Good Enough:** The fundamenta
 l inadequacy story.\n**Week 2 — Comparison:** Measuring ourselves agains
 t other people.\n**Week 3 — I'm a Fraud / They'll Find Me Out:** Imposte
 r feelings\, competence and exposure.\n**Week 4 — Being Loved\, Accepted
  & Enough:** Inadequacy in relationships\, belonging and being seen by oth
 ers.\n**Week 5 — Achievement & Where I Should Be:** Success\, progress\,
  potential and the feeling that we should be further along.\n\nThe course 
 gently moves from the broader experience of inadequacy into increasingly s
 pecific areas where it can show up in our lives.\n\nAs we gently move into
  each topic\, you are invited to become still and notice any stressful tho
 ught\, belief or experience that arises through the inquiry\, and to write
  it down — either on a notepad or in an electronic document.\n\nEach ses
 sion explores one stressful thought\, or “one-liner\,” using a format 
 known as Popcorn Work. This is the same approach Emrys uses in his weekly 
 *[The Work Runs Free](https://www.meetup.com/thework-runsfree/)* group. Ev
 eryone participates in their own inquiry\, but there is no expectation to 
 share. You are equally welcome to keep your inquiry entirely private\, if 
 that feels right for you.\n\nThe group is deliberately small\, with a maxi
 mum of 10 participants\, allowing us to explore together while each person
  remains connected to their own experience.\n\nPlease note that this is a 
 paid course. In order to join you must register for the event (sign up for
 m above). The Zoom link for this event will be sent around 24 hours after 
 registration and payment has been made.\n\n**To book a free introductory p
 rivate session of The Work with Emrys\, [click here](https://calendly.com/
 mindfulnesswithemrys/onehoursession)[.](https://mindfulnesswithemrys.busin
 ess.site/)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/316706393/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260925T084740Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T084740Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_316970384@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052248Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261102T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261102T205000
SUMMARY:Inner Body Meditation (20 minutes)
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\n"Awareness of the inner body takes you bey
 ond the mind." - Eckhart Tolle\n\nIn this mediation session we will bring 
 our attention here: to the inner body. Sessions are suitable for newcomers
 \, those experienced in Tolle's teachings and anyone wishing to remain com
 pletely anonymous. They will last around 20 minutes and cameras and microp
 hones will be disabled.\n(Depending on the situation\, a free discussion m
 ay be held at the end with mics and cameras allowed.)\n\nSee you there!\n\
 nPlease be aware that sessions will close if no members have joined after 
 10 minutes.\n\nEmrys also organises a free Work of Byron Katie online medi
 ation group. Visit [this Meetup Group link](https://www.meetup.com/thework
 -runsfree/) for more information.21
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/316970384/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261014T021417Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T021417Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
